>10 DIM code% 100
>20 FOR pass%=0 TO 2 STEP 2
>30 P%=code%
>40 [OPT pass%
>50 .start LDA #&41
>60 STA &0800
>70 LDX #3
>80 .loop DEX
>90 BNE loop
>100 LDQ &10
>110 STQ &14
